    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if a professional can even fix this. it's not just \"stress,\" it's like... my whole life is just a series of mistakes that I can't undo. the more I try to fix things, the deeper the hole gets. it feels so permanent. like this is just how it's gonna be forever, just more and more exhaustion until there's nothing left.",
